# Laid out Medium on an opened fold's inner screen (MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2): the page brought over, its
# messages scrolled up and down, the sidebar brought over and the page again: the composer goes with its page.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tapxy -80 420
wait 900
wheel -300
wait 500
wheel 300
wait 500
back
wait 900
tapxy -80 420
wait 900
exit
